Author: alex <sunny413x@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed May 27 23:43:21 2026 +0300

    feat: task 2 — admin alerts E031-E033 for t-hunted parser
    
    Adds three new admin-alert builders following the existing E001-E030
    pattern: alert_t_hunted_host_rejected (E031, SSRF rejection),
    alert_t_hunted_fetch_error (E032, HTTP/timeout error), and
    alert_t_hunted_no_body (E033, parser couldn't find article body).
    All three placed between E028 (last lamley alert) and E030
    (orangetrack aggregator), matching the lamley E025/E027/E028 shape.
    
    Task 1's parser already references these builders; Task 2 makes
    those references real (Task 1's autouse monkeypatch becomes a
    redundant safety net).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

